{"step_index":733,"source":"MODEL","type":"GENERIC","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-24T05:21:07Z","content":"Created At: 2026-08-24T10:51:07+05:30\nCompleted At: 2026-08-24T10:51:13+05:30\nThe search for \"leetcode api open source problems dataset json github\" returned the following summary:\nThere are several open-source repositories and datasets available on GitHub and other platforms that provide LeetCode problems in JSON or CSV formats. Since LeetCode does not provide an official public API for fetching full problem content, these datasets are typically created via community scraping projects.\n\n### Notable Datasets (JSON/CSV)\n*   **[LeetCode Problems Dataset](https://huggingface.co/datasets/Alishohadaee/leetcode-problems-dataset):** Available on Hugging Face, this repository provides a comprehensive collection of LeetCode problems, including metadata, descriptions, and solutions in both `.json` and `.csv` formats[1][2].\n*   **[A Complete Database of LeetCode Problems (JSON)](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQG0jZoAA0ZC6VfExJXeIaHByZr1xKer5SSSzyga6IdtqqAPZc0WIWPllNuwLGpuM-LF9ff77oioKrEa-RfsdE2MgQEI4Wi6y_P5tXahZBdDtgVervDraFWAhamLa10zbn3e):** A GitHub-based repository that organizes LeetCode problems into individual JSON files, with a `merged_problems.json` file for consolidated access[3][4].\n*   **[LeetCodeDataset (newfacade/LeetCodeDataset)](https://github.com/newfacade/LeetCodeDataset):** A high-quality benchmark dataset specifically curated for evaluating and training large language models (LLMs), featuring rich metadata and test cases[5].\n\n### Unofficial LeetCode APIs\nIf you prefer to fetch data programmatically rather than using a static dataset, several open-source projects act as wrappers for LeetCode's internal GraphQL API:\n\n*   **[alfa-leetcode-api](https://github.com/alfaarghya/alfa-leetcode-api):** A well-regarded, custom-built API that provides endpoints to retrieve user profiles, badges, contest history, and specific problem details[6][7].\n*   **[faisal-shohag/leetcode_api](https://github.com/faisal-shohag/leetcode_api):** A Node.js-based API that simplifies interaction with LeetCode’s GraphQL endpoints, useful for fetching submission calendars and user statistics[8].\n*   **[noworneverev/leetcode-api](https://github.com/noworneverev/leetcode-api):** A high-performance, caching-enabled API wrapper built with FastAPI, designed for building dashboards and data analysis tools[9].\n\n### Important Considerations\n*   **Terms of Service:** Much of this data is scraped from LeetCode[1][10]. Please be mindful that using these datasets and APIs is generally intended for **educational and research purposes only**[1][2].\n*   **Premium Content:** Most open-source datasets explicitly exclude \"Premium\" LeetCode problems to comply with copyright and terms of service policies[1][2][10].\n*   **Data Freshness:** Because these projects rely on unofficial methods, their data may become outdated if LeetCode updates their website structure. Check the \"Last Updated\" date on the respective GitHub repository before relying on a specific dataset[11][12].\n\nSources:\n[1] [kaggle.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGw3DHZUWi3ABQmCwBPalVqz54hU5tZIdK8RXaxOjnsv9y9h0pij92AvrqeLguW4_N1KHNK-4f5W7FVqn8LCrOt8ieUU8eNjFitIeVJjVYlWA2DY1yqzjsZH_xb4-aS5TdNYaDx-JItYzRJirvtDECHzRzxJcrHCBi718s0)\n[2] [huggingface.co](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQF57c_i64-N179_eSVyaE24AktLRetr4x2oq4Ew9Yn0b7aAuI7AElKiQyecuozr4BiS1gNs2UssI-H_nP3WcC5RW5piBuoGmVdFuOnIdiBxG1q7lScoig4GI52JFgivYRkLqBge-pnhs-2GwcvINT4EP47lYRNI0LFJ_LFV)\n[3] [github.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQG0jZoAA0ZC6VfExJXeIaHByZr1xKer5SSSzyga6IdtqqAPZc0WIWPllNuwLGpuM-LF9ff77oioKrEa-RfsdE2MgQEI4Wi6y_P5tXahZBdDtgVervDraFWAhamLa10zbn3e)\n[4] [github.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQG0jZoAA